-- Moviezzz real-movie catalog: 3200 films, 4810 actors, 550 directors.
-- Run ONCE, after 01_schema.sql and 02_seed.sql, in the moviezzz database. Adds rows only; changes nothing existing.
-- New movie/actor/director ids start at 1001. Fails with a duplicate-key error (and adds nothing) if already imported.
-- Sources:
--   vega-datasets movies.json (BSD-3-Clause), https://github.com/vega/vega-datasets: title, release date, MPAA rating, runtime, major genre, director.
--   prust/wikipedia-movie-data (text from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0), https://github.com/prust/wikipedia-movie-data: cast, genres, summary.
-- Generated by a script; some release dates, runtimes and matches may be imperfect. Runtime is missing for many films.
SET NAMES utf8mb4;
START TRANSACTION;
COMMIT;
